=== reading ===
A: if the six fractions are flat across DP 20-240 (bar beta-beta), the
   reported linkage inventory does not depend on the single-molecule size.
B: n_frags rises only as oo_scale -> 0, where 5-5 and 4-O-5 collapse below
   reference. Native fragmentation and the reference condensed content are
   mutually exclusive in this model, because condensation IS the welding.
   The 4-O-5 column shows whether its over-prediction is a welding artifact.
